# Weights are fetched (torch/) or generated (onnx/, npu/) and stay out of Git; manifest.json is
# committed. The exception is a model a Host runs: its torch weights (the Mac's source run, and the
# source of every export) and its compiled NPU graphs are LFS objects, and ops/component.toml carries
# the NPU set to the Host from these paths.
models/*/*/torch/
models/*/*/onnx/
models/*/*/npu/
!models/laya-smart-home/7b695ba8/torch/
!models/laya-smart-home/7b695ba8/npu/
!models/laya-participation/ae6718a4/torch/
!models/laya-participation/ae6718a4/npu/
# The NPU converter's inputs; the compiled .rknn are what runs.
models/*/*/npu/*.onnx
.venv/
.env
train/private/

# participation: raw GLM responses and the call ledger stay local (accepted episodes are committed)
train/data/participation/glm-ledger/
train/data/participation/*/raw/
